@startuml 15-state-message
title Mesaj (Message / DirectMessage) Durum Diyagramı

state "Gönderildi" as Sent
state "Düzenlendi" as Edited
state "Silindi" as Deleted

[*] --> Sent : POST /api/socket/...\nmessage.create
Sent : deleted = false
Sent : createdAt == updatedAt

Sent --> Edited : PATCH (yalnızca sahibi)
Edited : updatedAt > createdAt
Edited : UI'da "(düzenlendi)" etiketi
Edited --> Edited : PATCH

Sent --> Deleted : DELETE\n(sahibi / ADMIN / MODERATOR)
Edited --> Deleted : DELETE
Deleted : deleted = true
Deleted : fileUrl = null
Deleted : content = "This message has been deleted"

Sent --> [*] : kanal / sunucu / üye\nsilinince (cascade)
Edited --> [*] : cascade
Deleted --> [*] : cascade
@enduml
